From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1ma <hello@1ma.ai>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:06:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] 1ma: desktop app identity, installer names and update
 feed

Rename the stable and nightly desktop identities to 1ma: app id
ai.1ma.desktop, product name 1ma, artifact and executable names, the
Windows AppUserModelID, the macOS microphone purpose string, and point the
update feed at the 1ma-ai/1ma releases. Tests follow the new identity.
---
 apps/desktop/electron-builder.config.json     | 10 +++++-----
 .../scripts/desktop-release-channel.d.mts     |  8 ++++----
 .../scripts/desktop-release-channel.mjs       | 20 +++++++++----------
 apps/desktop/src/desktop-update-provider.ts   |  6 +++---
 apps/desktop/src/main.ts                      |  4 ++--
 .../test/desktop-update-provider.test.ts      |  6 +++---
 .../test/electron-builder-config.test.ts      | 10 +++++-----
 7 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

